"[HEADER] Installation Infos",
"kill",
"When you click 'START SETUP' in the 'SETUP' tab, doometernal.apworld will be installed and moved into the 'custom_worlds' folder inside the Archipelago Launcher directory. Then, the AP Mod client (DOOM Eternal Archipelago) is installed inside 'Documents'.",
"kill",
"[HEADER] apworld / yaml Infos",
"kill",
"DOOM Eternal is not a core Archipelago game, it needs a custom world file. When 'doometernal.apworld' is downloaded in the Archipelago Folder (by clicking START SETUP), boot-up the Archipelago Launcher and go to 'Options Creator' to create your .yaml file and then, when you're done, send it to the person who will host the AP Multiworld.",
"kill",
"[HEADER] Connection Infos",
"kill",
"Once everything is setup, go to the 'DOOM Eternal Archipelago' folder in your 'Documents' directory and open 'DoomEternalArchipelagoLauncher.exe'. Go to the 'JOIN ROOM' tab.\n\nIn the 'SERVER' field, enter archipelago.gg: followed by the port. This is a 5-digit number that you can find on the website after creating a new room.\n\nIn 'PLAYER', enter the name assigned to your YAML file.\n\nThe 'PASSWORD' field is optional.\n\nFinally, click 'CONNECT', doing so should take you to the 'SESSION' tab. On this window, press 'INSTALL MOD', it should open a new command window, skip everything and go back to the 'DOOM Eternal Archipelago Launcher' to complete the setup (if you get a red/error message on the ModIjector window, see the 'Troubleshoot' window).\n\nAfter everything is complete, you will have to start the game through Steam (NOT 'With Mods' if it starts with the launcher). Once on the game, start a fresh new save and you can start playing!",
"kill",
"[HEADER] Revert Infos",
"kill",
"You have 2 revert options, both can't be enabled at the same time.\n\nIf you use the 'Clear AP Mods' option it will only delete the mods that are required for DOOM Eternal Archipelago. For this game it will only delete the mod zip folder and keep Meathook + Mod Injector.\n\nIf you use the 'Full Clear' option it will delete everything related to Mod Injector, Meathook and mods. If other mods are detected an additionnal confirmation will appear.",
"kill",
"[HEADER] Troubleshoot",
"kill",
"If the 'ModInjector' command prompt shows a red message after trying to install the mods with the launcher, simply verify DOOM Eternal's files integrity in your Steam library. Then, go back to the DOOM Eternal AP Launcher and retry the installation.",
